Pale Rider is a western, drama film directed by Clint Eastwood.

3
00:21:33,750 --> 00:21:39,750
A mysterious preacher protects a humble prospector village from a
greedy mining company trying to encroach on their land.

4
00:28:45,000 --> 00:28:51,000
Preacher, played by Clint Eastwood.

5
00:35:56,250 --> 00:36:02,250
Hull Barret, played by Michael Moriarty.

